Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main,,0000,0000,0000,,-- Usagi Drop Episode 09 --
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.39,0:00:04.93,Main,News,0000,0000,0000,,Typhoon No. 13 continues to exhibit strong signs of force as it makes its way up north.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.12,0:00:09.90,Main,News,0000,0000,0000,,It struck the Southern Daitou Islands at 11:00 PM last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.90,0:00:13.32,Main,News,0000,0000,0000,,So far there have been no reports on how this will affect transportation.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.61,0:00:17.32,Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.32,0:00:21.00,Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,They said the bullet trains are pooping!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.88,0:00:28.58,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,No, they said they're operating. {so Kouki thinks they said "unko" which means poop, but they said "unkou" which means in service/operating}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.59,0:00:29.88,Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Pooping?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.88,0:00:31.40,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,No, operating!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.40,0:00:35.05,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,They were probably reporting that the\Nbullet trains are still operating normally.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.05,0:00:38.33,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,They mean the trains are running as usual.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.75,0:00:43.14,Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,They're pooping!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.69,0:00:52.41,Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Now I have to poop!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.57,0:00:56.03,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Geez...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.77,0:01:01.75,Main,News,0000,0000,0000,,As the typhoon alters its route towards the east,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.74,0:01:06.00,Main,News,0000,0000,0000,,it is expected to make landfall in the Toukai region this evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.91,0:01:08.37,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Did she say typhoon?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.37,0:01:13.53,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Don't worry, typhoons come every year.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.80,0:01:13.51,Overlap,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.26,0:01:16.97,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Is there no toilet paper?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.97,0:01:18.47,Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,I've got a huge one!{rofl}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.47,0:01:20.14,Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Bring a ruler!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.14,0:01:23.44,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}I know boys will be boys, but still...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.44,0:01:26.01,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}I feel sorry for her.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.44,0:02:57.86,Presented By,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(165,0)\blur0.4\pos(591,287)}Presented by:
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.44,0:02:57.86,Presented By,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(165,0)\blur0.4\pos(775,287)}Taka Fansubs
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.91,0:03:14.71,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'm picking you up early today.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.71,0:03:15.82,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.50,0:03:18.04,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Let's go, Kouki-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.98,0:03:21.83,Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Wasn't that awesome?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.83,0:03:23.46,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,We're gonna be late.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.30,0:03:25.64,Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,See you!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.52,0:03:42.99,Main,Teach,0000,0000,0000,,If you've left enough space for small circles, you've written the character properly.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.01,0:03:43.75,Main,Teach,0000,0000,0000,,Alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.75,0:03:46.91,Main,Kid,0000,0000,0000,,Sensei, how much space should we leave?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.91,0:03:48.14,Main,Teach,0000,0000,0000,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.14,0:03:50.02,Main,Kid,0000,0000,0000,,How many centimeters? Or millimeters?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.63,0:04:01.48,Main,Teach,0000,0000,0000,,You don't have to actually draw the circles!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.48,0:04:03.21,Main,Kid,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.01,0:04:07.52,Main,Teach,0000,0000,0000,,Okay, finish the rest for homework.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.51,0:04:11.39,Main,Teach,0000,0000,0000,,Next, all the first graders will have art class.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.39,0:04:14.41,Main,Teach,0000,0000,0000,,Gather in front of each of your morning glories.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.41,0:04:15.55,Main,Teach,0000,0000,0000,,Understood?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.55,0:04:17.38,Main,Kid,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.12,0:04:31.14,Main,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Who knew sandbags were that heavy?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.12,0:04:33.79,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It's still morning and I'm already worn out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.79,0:04:36.54,Main,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,It's just our luck all those samples had to go out today.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.38,0:04:41.43,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.09,0:04:44.25,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.31,0:04:47.96,Main,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,It's my kids' educational endowment insurance.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.97,0:04:51.27,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What?! Aren't your kids still babies?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.27,0:04:54.43,Main,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,I can't wait until they're older to get insurance.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.43,0:04:56.79,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.79,0:04:59.22,Main,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,I'm on that plan too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.22,0:05:02.41,Main,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Although I don't think any kid of mine dreams of college. {implying he himself didn't, so his kids wont}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.41,0:05:05.80,Main,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Money's tight since we have two kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.80,0:05:09.73,Main,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Ours is still just a baby, but even\Ndaycare costs are crazy these days.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.73,0:05:11.64,Main,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Plus he grows out of his clothes constantly.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.64,0:05:14.83,Main,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,We may not be full-time employees here,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.83,0:05:19.13,Main,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,but it's nice they give us a welfare pension and health insurance.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.13,0:05:21.87,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What about life insurance?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.88,0:05:23.96,Main,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,My wife handled all that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.96,0:05:26.52,Main,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,If I go under, she gets a decent sum,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.52,0:05:28.57,Main,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,but she's just on a savings coverage.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.55,0:05:30.05,Main,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,She says it's standard...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.97,0:05:34.06,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,You guys really seem like dads.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.07,0:05:35.55,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Good for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.56,0:05:38.06,Main,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,It's not that big of a deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.06,0:05:42.31,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}I wonder how much insurance costs?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.32,0:05:47.15,Main,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,We've been meaning to move away from the noisy kid next door, but we don't have the money to.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.15,0:05:51.23,Main,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,I don't even know what I'm working for anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.00,0:05:53.54,Main,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,You better be listening to us!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.54,0:05:55.42,Main,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,This is what happens when you get married!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.42,0:05:58.78,Main,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,I don't even have a girlfriend, so no problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.33,0:06:02.09,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}They may complain a lot,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.14,0:06:07.47,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}but they really do care.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.41,0:06:12.72,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}I can't see them turning into someone like Rin's mother.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.16,0:06:34.03,Main,Teach,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.03,0:06:36.80,Main,Teach,0000,0000,0000,,Sit down and draw!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.32,0:06:45.92,Main,Kid,0000,0000,0000,,Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.88,0:06:52.18,Main,Teach,0000,0000,0000,,And where is your drawing board? {wording on purpse to sound condescending}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.18,0:06:55.84,Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,I don't need it, the ground's smooth.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.84,0:06:58.18,Main,Teach,0000,0000,0000,,Don't pull one on me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.18,0:07:00.60,Main,Teach,0000,0000,0000,,Bring something when I tell you to bring it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.60,0:07:03.11,Main,Teach,0000,0000,0000,,Run and go get it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.38,0:07:10.77,Main,Kid,0000,0000,0000,,You're really good at drawing, Rin-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.77,0:07:13.65,Main,Kid,0000,0000,0000,,She's right! It's really pretty!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.66,0:07:15.28,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,It is?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.28,0:07:17.83,Main,Teach,0000,0000,0000,,You really are good!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.66,0:07:22.91,Main,Teach,0000,0000,0000,,The colors of these two flowers are different,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.92,0:07:27.67,Main,Teach,0000,0000,0000,,and you did a great job of drawing them blue and purple.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.87,0:07:31.09,Main,Teach,0000,0000,0000,,You have a knack for this!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.02,0:07:40.81,Main,Kid,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki-kun and those boys are goofing off again!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.34,0:07:48.05,Main,Teach,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.05,0:07:50.84,Main,Teach,0000,0000,0000,,We're having art class now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.70,0:07:55.20,Main,Teach,0000,0000,0000,,Your morning glories look great, Kouki-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.77,0:07:58.88,Main,Teach,0000,0000,0000,,They deserve to be drawn!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.87,0:08:01.12,Main,Teach,0000,0000,0000,,Do you like drawing?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.12,0:08:04.24,Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Sort of, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.24,0:08:09.23,Main,Teach,0000,0000,0000,,Tatsumi-sensei, I'm in charge of this boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.21,0:08:13.09,Main,Teach,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki-san, why are you always stirring up trouble?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.09,0:08:15.13,Main,Teach,0000,0000,0000,,Sit down and draw!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.13,0:08:16.86,Main,Teach,0000,0000,0000,,And don't make any faces!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.03,0:08:33.02,Main,Kid,0000,0000,0000,,We got Kouki's cap!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.02,0:08:34.53,Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Give it back!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.87,0:08:40.32,Main,Teach,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, you boys! Stop that!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.32,0:08:41.20,Main,Teach,0000,0000,0000,,Come back here!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.20,0:08:43.64,Main,Kid,0000,0000,0000,,We got it! It's ours!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.90,0:08:49.75,Main,Kid,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.00,0:08:57.31,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki-kun, just sit down and draw!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.30,0:08:58.47,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Don't let them taunt you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.46,0:09:06.19,Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.03,0:09:20.68,Main,Kid,0000,0000,0000,,You're really brave, Rin-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.68,0:09:25.49,Main,Kid,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki-kun's always acting weird, and it's scary when he gets mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.49,0:09:28.40,Main,Kid,0000,0000,0000,,He's going to pick on you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.40,0:09:30.02,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,No, he won't!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.02,0:09:32.79,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,We went to the same daycare.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.79,0:09:33.70,Main,Kid,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.70,0:09:35.30,Main,Kid,0000,0000,0000,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.23,0:09:53.51,Main,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,They're late.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.35,0:10:02.23,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,You guys pick your kids up at six too, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.23,0:10:04.54,Main,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, it'll be close today. {barely make it on time}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.54,0:10:06.90,Main,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,They're here!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.90,0:10:12.86,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Alright, let's do this in one trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.86,0:10:14.00,Main,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.84,0:10:23.32,Main,Boobs,0000,0000,0000,,Good evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.32,0:10:26.00,Main,Boobs,0000,0000,0000,,A little wet, aren't you? {do i sense reverse sexual innuendo}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.97,0:10:29.23,Main,Boobs,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan, your dad's here!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.22,0:10:30.99,Main,Boobs,0000,0000,0000,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.98,0:10:33.73,Main,Boobs,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, I'm sorry. {since he's not he real dad}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.73,0:10:35.72,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,No, don't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.72,0:10:38.14,Main,Boobs,0000,0000,0000,,I'll go get her.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.45,0:10:41.50,Main,Boobs,0000,0000,0000,,It's pretty windy out there, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.50,0:10:45.18,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. I would have liked to get here earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.18,0:10:46.86,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Am I the last one?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.86,0:10:48.77,Main,Boobs,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki-kun's still here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.75,0:10:50.42,Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.05,0:10:52.45,Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,You see the storm?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.46,0:10:54.59,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Yup, it's wild outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.47,0:11:07.27,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry I'm late.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.27,0:11:07.95,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.69,0:11:11.43,Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,There's an umbrella flying!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.43,0:11:13.14,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Did something happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.14,0:11:14.39,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,No, I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.04,0:11:21.15,Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,See you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.15,0:11:23.62,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,See you later, Kouki!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.09,0:11:42.13,Main,Both,0000,0000,0000,,Wanna come home with us?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.94,0:11:46.34,Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.82,0:11:52.10,Main,Boobs,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry, but we can't let him go home with someone else. {lit. it's already been decided who he goes home with}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.10,0:11:53.18,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.18,0:11:56.57,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,But the weather's only going to get worse later on,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.57,0:11:59.88,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,so if it's not a problem I'll call Nitani-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.88,0:12:03.44,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'll let you speak to her as well to confirm.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.61,0:12:06.86,Main,Boobs,0000,0000,0000,,Well, in that case...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.86,0:12:09.25,Main,Boobs,0000,0000,0000,,We'll be able to go home early too!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.25,0:12:10.59,Main,Boobs,0000,0000,0000,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.50,0:12:14.13,Main,Boobs,0000,0000,0000,,We're just kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.59,0:12:36.76,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.76,0:12:37.52,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I want to too!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.35,0:12:39.29,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Rin!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.95,0:12:49.89,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Be careful!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.89,0:12:51.43,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Follow after me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.96,0:13:00.98,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Stop right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.98,0:13:03.55,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'll get you a towel.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.38,0:13:05.97,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, the storm shutters!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.39,0:13:21.98,Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Awesome! Let me try!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.38,0:13:26.97,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Alright, just watch your hands. {don't let your hand get caught in between}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.07,0:13:35.37,Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,It's so dark!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.01,0:13:49.29,Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,It's like a secret fort in here!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.17,0:13:54.82,Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Ow, it got in my eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.82,0:13:57.01,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Keep your eyes shut so I can wash it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.86,0:14:04.42,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Alright, dry yourself now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.82,0:14:11.83,Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Your back is huge, Daikichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.65,0:14:17.02,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.90,0:14:22.46,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Good evening, it's Nitani.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.46,0:14:25.23,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'm coming! {TEHEHEHE SEXUAL INUENDO}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.21,0:14:28.01,Bd1,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur0.4\pos(477,188)}Kaga Rin
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.21,0:14:28.01,Bd2,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur0.4\pos(373,474)}Daikichi
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.21,0:14:28.01,Bd3,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur0.4\pos(783,265)}Daikichi's meat and potato\Nstew is really delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.21,0:14:28.01,Be4,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur0.4\pos(695,496)}And he can run really fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.99,0:14:30.93,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,So I guess you were able to leave work early.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.61,0:14:34.00,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry for taking matters into my own hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.00,0:14:37.54,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,No, please! You really helped me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.52,0:14:40.69,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry I got Kouki dripping wet too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.69,0:14:45.03,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Please, I can't thank you enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.61,0:14:55.15,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It fits you perfectly!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.60,0:15:00.20,Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, let me have some of your clothes!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.20,0:15:02.56,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,I told you to say "Daikichi-san"!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.56,0:15:04.78,Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,He said just "Daikichi" is fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.78,0:15:08.06,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I feel better when he just calls me that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.06,0:15:11.48,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah! Calling him "Daikichi" is fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.35,0:15:22.03,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,You're really good at that, Rin-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.03,0:15:24.02,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I know how to use a knife too!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.02,0:15:26.64,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Wow, you're like a young lady!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.64,0:15:28.47,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi uses the stove though.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.47,0:15:30.07,Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,I'll help!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.99,0:15:34.77,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,But you never help out.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.77,0:15:36.59,Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,I'll help cut too!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.59,0:15:39.04,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,You can use my knife!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.08,0:15:46.25,Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Ow! I hate onions!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.25,0:15:50.04,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Don't touch your eyes! Go wash them right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.90,0:15:53.15,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.88,0:15:53.13,Overlap,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Now I'm crying!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.89,0:16:02.06,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Making hamburger patties?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.06,0:16:03.64,Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Yup.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.65,0:16:06.46,Main,,0000,0000,0000,,Looks good, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.88,0:16:09.22,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,These don't look right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.22,0:16:12.42,Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,They're fine! Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.40,0:16:15.70,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Well, they should taste fine. {implying the shapes are off}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.70,0:16:19.03,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan, the eggs are done boiling!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.04,0:16:20.70,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Please peel them!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.70,0:16:22.79,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.80,0:16:29.66,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.66,0:16:30.85,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,You're amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.85,0:16:34.53,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Rin's in her element.{\i0} {lit. Rin's in great spirits/ecstatic}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.76,0:16:40.39,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki, do you love your mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.85,0:16:47.21,Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Maybe if she wasn't such a nagging old lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.72,0:16:56.28,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}They really care for each other too.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.04,0:17:01.74,Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,I call this one!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.74,0:17:03.89,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,You didn't give thanks for the meal!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.91,0:17:09.16,Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks for this meal!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.16,0:17:11.34,Main,All,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you for this meal.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.72,0:17:26.80,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki, use your chopsticks.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.80,0:17:28.71,Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,I'm just moving it together.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.45,0:17:42.85,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Isn't it yummy?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.85,0:17:47.21,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Food really does taste better when we're all together!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.21,0:17:49.74,Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Let's eat here again tomorrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.74,0:17:50.94,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.22,0:18:04.56,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Don't worry about the rest, I'll finish them later.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.56,0:18:06.16,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.35,0:18:13.98,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,And then it fell right on his head!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.62,0:18:17.47,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,He's so happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.47,0:18:21.21,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,I was never able to give him this kind of chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.21,0:18:24.06,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,This evening really was great.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.06,0:18:25.82,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.82,0:18:28.41,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Please! I should be thanking you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.44,0:18:32.49,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Sensei said not to draw the circles!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.49,0:18:38.16,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,I'm glad I got to leave work early so I could see him smiling like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.93,0:18:42.92,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}She's raising a child all alone as well.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.92,0:18:46.40,Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, come over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.39,0:18:47.93,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.26,0:18:57.17,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,I think we should go home now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.17,0:18:58.77,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Should I call a taxi?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.77,0:19:01.36,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.64,0:19:05.12,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Will you stay over?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.95,0:19:08.37,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Rin!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.37,0:19:10.88,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Well, Reina-chan and her mom did!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.88,0:19:13.28,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,That was different!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.92,0:19:17.88,Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Later.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.88,0:19:19.55,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,See you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.55,0:19:20.60,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Bye-bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.60,0:19:23.54,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you, Rin-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.54,0:19:25.59,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,And thank you for everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.59,0:19:28.30,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,We had fun too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.30,0:19:28.98,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.78,0:19:30.97,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.49,0:20:18.51,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Bye-bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.35,0:22:10.49,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,The typhoon's gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.49,0:22:11.97,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Yup.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.97,0:22:17.89,Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan! Rin-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.85,0:22:17.89,Overlap,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki-kun's here already?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.89,0:22:20.09,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,He's early again!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.09,0:22:23.06,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Come in!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.06,0:22:25.11,Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.53,0:22:28.07,Main,Both,0000,0000,0000,,No, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.00,0:22:36.20,Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,I wanted to open up the storm shutters.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.00,0:22:44.75,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,The sky's all clear!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.40,0:22:47.35,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,We're leaving!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.97,0:22:49.63,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki-kun, we're gonna be late.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.71,0:22:51.96,Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,See you.
